      "page": 2,
      "text": "Experiments on SkillsBench Experimental Setup We evaluate SkillEvolver (Zhang et al. 2026a), SPARK (Zhou et al. 2026b), and CoEvoSkills (Zhang et al. 2026b) on SkillsBench (Li et al. 2026), with two runs per method. Each run pairs an execution using the generated or evolved skill with a no-skill execution of the same task. Both runs of each method use the same task set: 81 tasks for SkillEvolver, 84 for SPARK, and 85 for CoEvoSkills. We report mean verifier reward on a 0–100 scale and the mean within-task difference between the skill and no-skill conditions. For a run with N tasks, the paired gain is",
